  "bodyHash": "4c48714dfaae0103",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#3598db\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1098920/description_0fb5046e-db7e-4520-a019-11a6b8af5fd2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"449\" height=\"449\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#3598db\"><strong>这是模组版本！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>数据包版本可在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/revamped-shipwrecks-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">此处</span></a>获取</strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><strong><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#669\"><span style=\"color:#339\"><a style=\"color:#339\" href=\"https://discord.gg/xJZbkfPrxJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span> </span></span></span></span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808000\"><strong><a style=\"color:#808000\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCu6eJhzS4tdXTMT8LUQf8EA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YouTube</a> | <a style=\"color:#808000\" href=\"https://github.com/WightofShadows/Wabi_Sabi_Structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808000\"><strong><a style=\"color:#808000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fshop.purehosted.net%252faff%252fwabi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#808000;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9d8562bdfd73d6791356358199128987baf1ee1f_0.webp\" alt=\"PureHosted 服务器 10% 优惠券，Revamped Shipwrecks 自定义横幅\" width=\"600\" height=\"100\"></span></span></a></strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Revamped&nbsp;Shipwrecks</em> 旨在让每次遇到的沉船都独一无二：通过将船只拆分为三个部分，并从包含自定义与熟悉设计的多样化池子中随机组合各部分。因此，每个 <em>Revamped Shipwrecks</em> 沉船都拥有有趣的新入口，需要采用不同的探索方式！&nbsp;</h4>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpostimg.cc%252fhhfRMGXg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/nV1VFjZs/optimized-text.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\"></a></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">重塑沉船包含垂直方向的残骸，它们可以指向上方或指向下方。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ZnZ8uqXN/images/e2f1dde404bd9494609c5cba9ed67d04c6a2dad6.png\" alt=\"向下垂直残骸\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ZnZ8uqXN/images/d2a2561e0548586de8f4e8fc732a3065f644cfeb.png\" alt=\"向上垂直残骸\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">残骸碎片也会根据损坏程度生成周围的沉船结构。它们甚至偶尔会生成完全缺失的部分，与较短的变体断开连接！</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ZnZ8uqXN/images/d8a9f14491de4464a2f4744fca482848725d1e01.png\" alt=\"断开的后部结构\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">原版沉船仍有可能随机生成，但你更有可能遇到<strong>全新的体验</strong>。<em>Revamped Shipwrecks</em> 还包含了原版使用的所有木材类型！</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/d3nJ4XnR/optimized-text-1.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\"></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Revamped Shipwrecks</em> 模组不会修改战利品表，仅改变宝箱在船上的生成位置。&nbsp;</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>安装方法：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bPe9GDA.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"52\" height=\"56\"></strong><strong><em>Revamped Shipwrecks</em> 的 Fabric 版本需要 Fabric Loader 和 Fabric API。</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>下载 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252finstaller%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric 安装器</a>。</li>\n<li>安装与你所使用的模组版本兼容的 Fabric Loader 版本。</li>\n<li>找到你的 .minecraft 目录。如果里面已有 “mods” 文件夹则打开它，否则创建一个并打开。</li>\n<li>下载 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a> 和 <strong>Revamped Shipwrecks</strong>，并将它们的 .jar 文件放入 mods 文件夹中。</li>\n<li>使用新安装的 Fabric 启动 Minecraft。\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jLOz8nt.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>Revamped Shipwrecks</em> 的 Forge 版本需要 Forge Mod Loader。</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>下载并安装与你所使用的模组版本兼容的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a> 版本。</li>\n<li>找到你的 .minecraft 目录。如果里面已有 “mods” 文件夹则打开它，否则创建一个并打开。</li>\n<li>下载 <strong>Revamped Shipwrecks</strong>，并将其 .jar 文件放入 mods 文件夹中。</li>\n<li>使用新安装的 Forge 启动 Minecraft。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\">查看我们的其他模组：</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pale-formations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/sJcvkhDc/5b1f4b7e261a4d31499986937acfcc660a8548cf.gif\" alt=\"Pale Formations 标志\" width=\"187\" height=\"187\"></a><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><a style=\"color:#7e8c8d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pale-formations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Pale Formations</span></a></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1EiT59N.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"116\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">Wabi-Sabi Structures - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wabi-sabi-structures-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric 版</a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wabi-sabi-structures-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge 版</a></span></span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">&nbsp;| <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/wabi-sabi-structures-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">数据包版</a></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/534/260/2022-12-04_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Unwrecked Ships - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unwrecked-ships-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric 版</a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unwrecked-ships-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge 版</a></span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;| <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unwrecked-ships-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">数据包版</a></span></strong></span></p>",
